# prefix-block-opener-inline-comment

## Input

```
server. # the web server
  host localhost

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..42
  PREFIX_BLOCK@0..42
    WORD_KEY@0..7
      WORD@0..7 "server."
    SPACE@7..8 " "
    COMMENT@8..24 "# the web server"
    NEWLINE@24..25 "\n"
    SPACE@25..27 "  "
    ENTRY@27..42
      WORD_KEY@27..31
        WORD@27..31 "host"
      SPACE@31..32 " "
      LINE_STRING@32..41
        STRING@32..41 "localhost"
      NEWLINE@41..42 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        PrefixBlock {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..7 "server.",
            },
            items: [
                Entry {
                    key: WordKey {
                        word: WORD@27..31 "host",
                    },
                    value: LineString {
                        string: STRING@32..41 "localhost",
                    },
                },
            ],
        },
    ],
}
```

